Error [E0712]: this `#Caps` region uses the effect `FS`, which it has no authority for
  --> tests/ui/crypto_expert_nonce_region_caps_precedence.jet:6:10
    |
  6 |     #Caps(Net) {
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: `#Caps(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: add `FS` to the `#Caps(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
